=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ TAR @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt GNU tar @VERSION@ for OpenVMS
1 'NOTICE
=prompt GNU tar is free software under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later; see COPYING.
1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [TAR.DOC]README.VMS under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for GNU tar
    At system startup: to define TAR$ROOT at every boot, add this line to
    SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM:
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:TAR$STARTUP.COM
    For each user: to define the commands, add this line to LOGIN.COM:
    $ @TAR$ROOT:[000000]TAR$SETUP.COM

PRODUCT REMOVE TAR removes the product and deassigns TAR$ROOT.
